---
layout: layout.njk
title: Featured Listings
description: Featured listings and how Sodeman Realty approaches property search in Lansing, Michigan.
---

<section class="container section">
  <h1>Featured Listings</h1>

  {% if listings.items and listings.items.length %}
    <p class="muted">Selected opportunities in the {{ site.service_area_short }} area. Links open the full listing page.</p>
    <div class="listing-grid">
      {% for item in listings.items %}
        <a class="listing-card" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {% if item.image %}
            <img class="listing-img" src="{{ item.image }}" alt="" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="listing-img" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="listing-meta">
            <div class="listing-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
            <div class="listing-sub">{{ item.subtitle }}</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p class="muted">No featured listings are published on the site right now.</p>
    <div class="empty-panel">
      <p>
        Sodeman Realty focuses on buyer and investor representation: defining constraints, screening inventory,
        and advancing offers that fit the plan. When a property is a strong fit for public highlight, it will appear here with a link to the full listing.
      </p>
      <p>
        For current opportunities in {{ site.service_area_short }}, the fastest path is a short consult so search criteria are set before you tour.
      </p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="tel:{{ site.phone_tel }}">Call {{ site.phone_display }}</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/contact/#schedule">Request a Consultation</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email Joel</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
